meta {
  name: 2d. Azure Cluster Create (Azure 클러스터 생성)
  type: http
  seq: 13
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/vms
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  content-type: application/json
  Idempotency-Key: {{$randomUUID}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "vmGroupName": "{{provision_cluster_name}}",
    "provider": "AZURE",
    "description": "Azure VM 기반 Kubernetes 클러스터",
    "environment": "{{provision_environment}}",
    "region": "{{provision_region}}",
    "credentialId": "{{credential_id}}",
    "spec": {
      "osImage": "{{azure_image}}",
      "masterInstanceType": "{{master_vm_spec}}",
      "workerInstanceType": "{{worker_vm_spec}}",
      "workerCount": "{{worker_count}}",
      "kubernetesVersion": "{{kubernetes_version}}",
      "enableIngress": "{{enable_ingress}}",
      "enableGpuOperator": "{{enable_gpu_operator}}",
      "network": {
        "vpcCidr": "{{vpc_cidr}}",
        "podCidr": "{{pod_cidr}}",
        "serviceCidr": "{{service_cidr}}"
      }
    },
    "providerSpec": {
      "resourceGroup": "{{azure_resource_group}}"
    }
  }
}

script:post-response {
  if (res.body && res.body.data && res.body.data.id) {
    bru.setEnvVar('last_operation_id', res.body.data.id);
  }
}

tests {
  test("상태 코드 202", function() {
    expect(res.getStatus()).to.equal(202);
  });
}

docs {
  ## Azure VM 기반 cluster 생성

  ### Required env vars (local-azure-provisioning.bru)
  - `provision_provider: AZURE`
  - `provision_region`: e.g. `eastus`, `koreacentral`
  - `credential_id`: Azure credential UUID
  - **`azure_resource_group`** (Azure 전용 필수): 모든 자원이 들어갈 RG 이름
  - `master_vm_spec` / `worker_vm_spec`: e.g. `Standard_D4s_v5`, `Standard_E4s_v5`

  ### Azure 만의 config
  - `anycloud-k8s:providerSpec.resourceGroup` (필수)
  - 옵션: `anycloud-k8s:osImage` — `Publisher:Offer:Sku:Version` 형식
    (예: `Canonical:ubuntu-24_04-lts:server:latest`)

  ### 실행
  ```bash
  bru run "VM Cluster (VM 클러스터)/2d. Azure Cluster Create (Azure 클러스터 생성).bru" \
      --env local-azure-provisioning
  ```
}
